{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32999","headline":"将赴天平职书怀寄翰林从兄 · 曹邺","name":"将赴天平职书怀寄翰林从兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居处绝人事，门前雀罗施。\n谁遣辟书至，仆隶皆展眉。\n匹马渡河洛，西风飘路岐。\n手执王粲笔，闲吟向旌旗。\n香晚翠莲动，吟余红烛移。\n开口啖酒肉，将何报相知。\n况我魏公子，相愿不相疑。\n岂学官仓鼠，饱食无所爲。\n白露沾碧草，芙蓉落清池。\n自小不到处，全家忽如归。\n吾宗处清切，立在白玉墀。\n方得一侍座，单车又星飞。\n愿将门底水，永托万顷陂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}